## 🔹 16. OBJECT ORIENTED PROGRAMMING (OOP)

### Class & Object

```python
class Person:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name

    def greet(self):
        print("Hello", self.name)

p = Person("Srishti")
p.greet()
```

